    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to even care about \"navigating\" it. you know? like why bother trying to rebuild something when the core of it is gone. it's not even sadness anymore, it's just... the weight of being a person i don't even recognize. it feels pointless to keep going through the motions when there's nobody actually home.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
