    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... it's exhausting. like i'm a hollow shell. i look in the mirror and i don't see a person who can \"drink a glass of water\" or \"be kind\" to themselves. i just see a body that's taking up space. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to end, because there's nothing left to actually live for. does that even make sense? that it feels more logical to just... cease?",
